stateDiagram-v2
    state "Waiting for eligible USB" as Waiting
    state "Mounting" as Mounting
    state "Active USB session" as Active
    state "Scanning" as Scanning
    state "Playlist published" as Published
    state "Scan failed, empty playlist" as ScanError
    state "Releasing session" as Releasing
    [*] --> Waiting
    Waiting --> Mounting: Add or enumerate eligible partition, scanner idle
    Waiting --> Waiting: Ignore ineligible devices or wait for the old scanner
    Mounting --> Waiting: Mount failed
    Mounting --> Active: Mount succeeded and scanner started
    Mounting --> Releasing: Scanner could not start
    state Active {
        [*] --> Scanning
        Scanning --> Published: Valid result, publish even an empty list
        Scanning --> ScanError: Scan failed, clear playlist
    }
    Active --> Releasing: Active USB removed or service shutdown
    Releasing --> Waiting: Cancel scan, clear playlist, release mount, request enumeration
    note right of Waiting
        Only one USB session is selected.
        Removing another device does not
        release the active session.
    end note
